"""Stage 13: within-image prototype reconstruction vs external memory.

Frozen 10k Dinomaly checkpoint. The encoder, bottleneck and original decoder
are not updated. A new INP-Former-style prototype decoder is trained on cached
672 features. See experiment/READING_AND_STAGE13_PLAN.md for the frozen rule.

Primary method: class-token recentering + 6 intrinsic prototypes + 8 prototype
attention blocks. Control: one unified kNN bank on the same recentered tokens.
Ablation: the same prototype module without recentering.

Entry, fixed before scores:
    b0_inp macro P-AP - b0 >= 0.01
    b0_inp > b0_knn
    at least 3 of 4 classes nonnegative vs b0
    no class drops more than 0.02
"""
